# Prompt-writing entry point

When the user asks for a prompt, first read `docs/PROMPT_RULES.md` in full and follow it.
Gather current repository context; do not implement the requested feature while drafting its prompt.
Deliver individual task prompts in chat, not files.
Use the shared document as the canonical policy rather than maintaining a second copy here.
